      "message": "The \u0027name\u0027 variable here is used to generate out/soong/Android-\u003ctarget\u003e_\u003cproduct\u003e.mk entries:\n\n  LOCAL_MODULE :\u003d com.android.art.debug.dex_bootjars_global_arm\n  LOCAL_MODULE :\u003d com.android.art.debug.dex_bootjars_global_arm64\n\nMaybe I should rename it to \u0027localModule\u0027. The filename is just \u0027boot.art\u0027, so the patha in apex are following the layout in the system image:\n\n  /boot/arm/boot.art\n  /boot/arm64/boot.art\n\nIf we decide on a different layout in future, it\u0027s easy to change on the Soong side (before the ART apex is released and someone may depend on this).",
